  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Turns an effect size (Cohen's d, odds ratio, Pearson's r and others), measurement reliability and outcome base rate into the classification performance you can expect (ROC/PR curves, sensitivity, specificity, PPV, NPV, net benefit), and also gives multi-predictor, calibration-transfer and sample-size estimates. Data used in the run: none. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
